				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 10 May 2015 06:24:03 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Technician Downs</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1399495</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Incredibly minor quibble:</p> <blockquote> <p><em>Waves gently <strong>slapped</strong> against the hull</em></p> </blockquote> <p>&quot;Slapped&quot; isn't the word you're looking for, here. I think you were thinking of &quot;lapped&quot;; they do sound similar. Anyway, &quot;slapped&quot; is incongruous with &quot;gently&quot;, as it implies a sort of force.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
